---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="SMS Consent & Disclosure — CC3PO" description="SMS text messaging consent, disclosures, and terms for CC3PO LLC services. A2P 10DLC compliant.">
  <section class="section legal-page" id="main-content" style="padding-top:120px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
      <h1>SMS Consent & Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: May 20, 2026</p>

      <div class="sms-notice" style="background:var(--accent-bg,rgba(0,180,216,0.08));border:1px solid var(--accent,rgba(0,180,216,0.3));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px;margin-bottom:32px;">
        <p style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;">📱 Program Description</p>
        <p>CC3PO LLC sends SMS text messages to provide service notifications, compliance alerts, appointment reminders, account updates, and customer support communications related to our AI compliance and automation platform.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Opt-In Consent</h2>
      <p>By providing your mobile phone number and checking the opt-in checkbox on our website forms, you consent to receive recurring SMS text messages from CC3PO LLC at the phone number you provide. Consent is not a condition of purchasing any goods or services.</p>
      <p><strong>How you can opt in:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Checking the SMS consent checkbox on our <a href="/contact">contact form</a></li>
        <li>Checking the SMS consent checkbox on our <a href="/audit">free audit form</a></li>
        <li>Checking the SMS consent checkbox on our <a href="/get-started">onboarding form</a></li>
        <li>Texting a keyword (e.g., START or YES) to our business number</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Message Frequency</h2>
      <p>Message frequency varies. Typically, you will receive:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service notifications:</strong> Up to 4 messages per month (compliance alerts, scan results)</li>
        <li><strong>Appointment/reminders:</strong> 1-2 messages per scheduled interaction</li>
        <li><strong>Account updates:</strong> As needed for service changes or security alerts</li>
        <li><strong>Customer support:</strong> In response to your inquiries, as needed</li>
      </ul>
      <p>At any time, you may contact us to adjust message frequency or opt out entirely.</p>

      <h2>3. Message & Data Rates</h2>
      <p>Standard message and data rates may apply based on your mobile carrier and service plan. CC3PO LLC does not charge you directly for SMS messages, but your carrier's standard rates apply. Check your mobile plan for details.</p>

      <h2>4. Opt-Out Instructions</h2>
      <p>You can opt out of SMS communications at any time by:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Replying STOP</strong> to any SMS message from us — you will be immediately unsubscribed</li>
        <li><strong>Replying HELP</strong> to any SMS message for assistance with opt-out or other questions</li>
        <li>Emailing us at <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a> with the subject line "SMS Opt-Out"</li>
        <li>Calling us at <a href="tel:+12097011137">(209) 701-1137</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p>After opting out, you may receive one final confirmation message. No further messages will be sent unless you opt in again.</p>

      <h2>5. HELP Keyword Support</h2>
      <p>At any time, you may text <strong>HELP</strong> to our business number for assistance including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Information about the messaging program</li>
        <li>How to opt out (STOP)</li>
        <li>Customer support contact details</li>
        <li>Link to this disclosure page</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Supported Carriers</h2>
      <p>SMS messaging is supported on the following major US wireless carriers: AT&T, Verizon, T-Mobile, US Cellular, and their respective MVNOs. We do not guarantee delivery to all carrier networks. International SMS is not currently supported.</p>

      <h2>7. Data Collection & Privacy</h2>
      <p>Your mobile phone number and SMS opt-in status are collected and stored securely. We use this information solely to deliver the SMS communications you have consented to receive. Key privacy commitments:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile opt-in data</strong> with third-party lead generators, data brokers, or marketing companies</li>
        <li>Your phone number is used only for the SMS program described above and related customer support</li>
        <li>SMS opt-in data is stored separately from marketing databases</li>
        <li>You may request deletion of your SMS data at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p>For full details, see our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>8. Program Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this SMS disclosure from time to time. Material changes will be communicated via SMS or email at least 30 days before taking effect. Continued participation after changes constitute acceptance.</p>

      <h2>9. Customer Care Contact</h2>
      <div style="background:var(--bg-card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;margin-top:16px;">
        <p style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>CC3PO LLC</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:8px;">16299 Adobe Way, Lathrop, CA 95330</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:8px;">📧 <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a></p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:8px;">📞 <a href="tel:+12097011137">(209) 701-1137</a></p>
        <p>🌐 <a href="https://cc3po.com">cc3po.com</a></p>
      </div>

      <h2>10. Related Policies</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a></li>
        <li><a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/accessibility-statement">Accessibility Statement</a></li>
      </ul>

      <div style="margin-top:48px;text-align:center;">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal-page p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .legal-page ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .legal-page li {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: color var(--duration-fast);
  }
  .legal-page a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  const ro=new IntersectionObserver((e)=>{e.forEach(en=>{if(en.isIntersecting){en.target.classList.add('revealed');ro.unobserve(en.target)}})},{threshold:0.15});
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el=>ro.observe(el));
</script>